1:# ISSUE-032 — Prose queue orchestration guidance
20:Make queued-goal steering treat prose/JIT orchestration as a first-class workflow without adding brittle prose parsing or unnecessary specialized tools.
45:- Request intake: `.ai/docs/issue-workflow/ISSUE-032-prose-queue-orchestration-guidance/00-request.md`
